            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "7. During the first five (5) working days of family leave for the birth, adoption, or placement of a child, an employee shall receive his/her regular weekly salary; subsequently, if the employee has accrued sick leave, vacation leave or personal leave credits available, the employee may use such credits for which he/she may otherwise be eligible under the sick leave, personal leave or vacation leave provisions of this agreement.",
